WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:28.250 --> 01:29.180
I'm Chocolat!

01:29.580 --> 01:31.710
For the Queen selection test,

01:31.710 --> 01:35.360
I came to the Human World with my best friend and rival, Vanilla.

01:35.790 --> 01:39.850
Whoever collects the most human
hearts gets to become Queen.

01:40.300 --> 01:45.710
I have a frog named Duke, and Vanilla has a
mouse named Blanca, as magical familiars,

01:45.970 --> 01:50.540
but Duke is no help at all, and it seem
like Blanca thinks of me as an enemy.

01:52.110 --> 01:55.040
It looks like Vanilla is more popular
with the human boys...

01:55.740 --> 01:59.040
I might... be in trouble here...

02:00.380 --> 02:04.020
Unscheduled newspaper club interview...

02:10.930 --> 02:13.500
Huh? You took another heart, Vanilla?

02:14.030 --> 02:15.200
Yeah, just now.

02:15.730 --> 02:19.870
When I was almost about to trip on
the stairs, this boy I didn't know...

02:26.040 --> 02:26.710
Huh?

02:30.650 --> 02:31.580
A heart!

02:33.850 --> 02:35.120
Sugar Sugar Rune!

02:35.980 --> 02:36.820
Vani Rune!

02:39.490 --> 02:39.890
Wand!

02:41.590 --> 02:43.490
Heart, heart, please come to me!

02:53.670 --> 02:55.500
Good for you, Vanilla...

02:55.500 --> 02:57.860
Though I've only taken one
"Pee" heart so far...

02:58.210 --> 03:00.880
I'm sure you'll take a lot
from now on, Chocolat.

03:08.920 --> 03:10.990
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

03:13.690 --> 03:15.620
Don't take people's pictures
without their permission!

03:16.290 --> 03:17.260
Who are you?

03:17.690 --> 03:20.430
Eh, um... I'm in your class...

03:20.900 --> 03:23.930
In my class?
But I don't remember you at all.

03:27.570 --> 03:29.700
I'm Nishitani... We're in the same class.

03:29.700 --> 03:30.410
The newspaper...

03:31.340 --> 03:32.410
The newspaper?

03:32.410 --> 03:35.910
I'm in the newspaper club, so that's
why I was taking your picture!

03:36.540 --> 03:37.880
Ah, Chocolat-chan!

03:40.850 --> 03:41.350
Sorry!

03:44.150 --> 03:46.450
I saw it! And it was orange too!

03:46.450 --> 03:47.960
Good for you, Chocolat-chan!

03:48.320 --> 03:48.690
Yeah!

03:49.080 --> 03:52.540
Newspaper Club

03:56.130 --> 03:58.130
Ah, Nishitani, I've been waiting for you.

03:58.570 --> 04:03.130
So, that new girl... She's an
alien, just like I said, right?

04:03.570 --> 04:06.010
Did you make contact with
their UFO and stuff?

04:06.470 --> 04:07.110
Akira!

04:08.810 --> 04:10.750
Chocolat Kato is cute!

04:11.810 --> 04:13.850
How is she an alien, jerk?!

04:13.850 --> 04:16.110
W-What's wrong, Nishitani?

04:16.620 --> 04:17.990
Why are you so mad?

04:19.090 --> 04:20.890
I'm not angry, really...

04:21.720 --> 04:22.890
Yeah you were!

04:23.560 --> 04:28.030
Chief, for the next special feature, how
about that mystery spot in the school?

04:28.360 --> 04:30.430
The ghost that appears
on the north stairway.

04:31.170 --> 04:33.600
Wait. The next special
feature will be on aliens.

04:34.040 --> 04:36.240
Look, a picture of an alien!

04:38.110 --> 04:40.380
No matter how you look at
it, that's still just your dog.

04:41.140 --> 04:43.410
I guess we should do the
ghost of the north stairway.

04:44.180 --> 04:46.350
No! It'll be on aliens.

04:46.350 --> 04:47.320
Neither.

04:49.650 --> 04:50.550
Since I've already decided...

04:52.090 --> 04:52.890
I'll write it.

04:53.760 --> 04:55.520
Hmm, how should I go about this...

04:59.030 --> 04:59.660
What the...?

05:09.000 --> 05:11.420
An orange heart, how lucky!

05:15.110 --> 05:18.510
I'll take that boy's heart
tomorrow, right away.

05:18.910 --> 05:19.680
That's right!

05:22.150 --> 05:25.640
Get hearts at school with
that kind of spirit!

05:26.020 --> 05:27.560
Don't come in here!

05:31.230 --> 05:32.090
I'll whup your butt!

05:33.960 --> 05:37.930
Even without Duke telling me, I know that
I should be targeting the boys at school.

05:39.130 --> 05:42.900
Classmates, and boys from middle school too.

05:43.940 --> 05:44.840
Middle school?

05:47.110 --> 05:48.510
Don't you know how to thank people?

05:50.010 --> 05:50.780
I'm speechless.

05:51.710 --> 05:52.310
Good morning.

05:55.480 --> 05:59.190
Pierre... with that calm, composed look...

05:59.890 --> 06:02.190
It irritates me just thinking about it!

06:02.860 --> 06:07.200
I've decided! The second orange
heart I'll take will be Pierre's!

06:13.570 --> 06:15.600
Chocolat-chan is acting kind of weird.

06:15.940 --> 06:19.510
It wouldn't be the first time for that girl.

06:20.340 --> 06:26.080
In any case, you should think about how
to get a lot more hearts than just one.

06:27.220 --> 06:30.020
Here's Blanca's One Point Advice:

06:30.520 --> 06:34.450
When talking with a boy, speak brightly with uplifting words,

06:34.450 --> 06:36.590
and with eyes upturned a little.

06:37.190 --> 06:39.290
Eh? Like this?

06:40.060 --> 06:43.460
Well, that's excellent, Vanilla-chama!

06:44.130 --> 06:45.100
Really?

06:45.830 --> 06:46.840
Yes!

06:48.100 --> 06:48.940
Sometimes I wonder...

06:52.070 --> 06:53.210
An... interview?

06:54.010 --> 06:56.080
Please, if you can.

06:57.680 --> 06:58.480
What for?

06:58.880 --> 07:02.020
Well, I want to put together a special feature on
the transfer students for the next newspaper.

07:03.080 --> 07:06.450
Is it okay if I ask you some questions?

07:07.220 --> 07:08.320
Sure, it's fine.

07:09.720 --> 07:12.590
Really? Then come by the library
during lunch break.

07:13.090 --> 07:14.100
Don't forget!

07:14.100 --> 07:14.960
Okay!

07:17.500 --> 07:21.770
Oh yeah! It's my chance to take his
heart when we're alone together!

07:28.310 --> 07:30.510
Please, let lunch break come soon!

07:38.590 --> 07:39.550
Hey, Kato!

07:40.860 --> 07:41.720
What, Akira?

07:42.290 --> 07:44.730
What are you doing with Nishitani?

07:45.760 --> 07:46.230
Huh?

07:46.930 --> 07:51.430
Ever since he took your picture,
he's been acting strange.

07:52.300 --> 07:58.510
He didn't listen to our suggestions, and
he's always spacing out like an idiot.

07:59.610 --> 08:02.440
And what exactly does
this have to do with me?

08:02.440 --> 08:03.480
It's got EVERYTHING to do with you!

08:04.290 --> 08:07.950
Cause that guy's totally got a crush on you!

08:09.820 --> 08:10.520
Wait just a second, Akira!

08:14.690 --> 08:17.390
What are you saying?!

08:17.690 --> 08:18.960
Am I wrong?

08:18.960 --> 08:20.860
That's not the point!

08:20.860 --> 08:25.420
I was just worried about you and she was...

08:25.970 --> 08:26.630
That's it!

08:29.100 --> 08:33.280
I'm through with you! Don't ever come
to the newspaper club again!

08:35.840 --> 08:37.080
Sure, fine.

08:40.850 --> 08:42.050
I'm sorry, Kato-san.

08:42.720 --> 08:43.550
Sure.

08:44.920 --> 08:46.220
Then, let's go to the library.

08:55.930 --> 09:00.200
He likes me enough to break
off his friendship with Akira?

09:01.800 --> 09:06.610
But Akira just told me how Nishitani
felt. Why would he be mad at that?

09:11.910 --> 09:15.920
Could it be that humans don't want
people to know they like them?

09:16.820 --> 09:18.350
Please, have a seat.

09:21.020 --> 09:22.540
Humans sure are different.

09:23.260 --> 09:24.630
Are you mad at something?

09:25.430 --> 09:27.430
Not really. Out with the questions already.

09:28.000 --> 09:31.900
Sure. Um... Any hobbies?

09:32.570 --> 09:34.770
Catchin' frogs and pretendin' to be spiders.

09:35.570 --> 09:36.540
Spiders?

09:38.110 --> 09:39.240
What's the next question?

09:39.940 --> 09:41.780
What's your favorite food?

09:41.780 --> 09:43.440
Chocolate and bone candy.

09:44.310 --> 09:47.000
Bone candy? Is that some new product?

09:47.280 --> 09:48.320
It's been around for a while.

09:49.820 --> 09:52.320
Uh... then, what's your favorite word?

09:53.120 --> 09:54.230
Butt whuppin'!

09:54.920 --> 09:57.090
You're... really different.

09:58.030 --> 09:59.930
Oh? What's the next question?

10:04.030 --> 10:06.530
What kind of boys do you like?

10:07.240 --> 10:08.700
Boys that I like?

10:09.740 --> 10:10.940
I don't have anyone like that.

10:11.270 --> 10:14.310
Then, ideally... What's your ideal type?

10:14.680 --> 10:16.580
Huh? Ideally?

10:21.580 --> 10:21.650
Pierre...

10:21.650 --> 10:22.120
Pierre...

10:22.120 --> 10:22.280
Pierre...

10:26.720 --> 10:29.090
Kato-san, your ideal type?

10:31.630 --> 10:33.610
I don't have an ideal type or anything...

10:34.360 --> 10:35.400
I see...

10:50.210 --> 10:53.810
That damned Pierre...
He totally ignored me!

10:54.650 --> 10:56.880
And he just said "Good morning"
to me the other day!

10:59.020 --> 11:02.090
Damn! I totally forgot
about Nishitani's heart!

11:14.240 --> 11:16.600
Good morning!

11:17.870 --> 11:21.080
Alright, I'll take Nishitani's
heart today for sure!

11:21.810 --> 11:22.310
Kato-san!

11:24.350 --> 11:25.610
Check out this book!

11:26.350 --> 11:27.210
Uh... sure.

11:28.720 --> 11:29.620
Well... see ya!

11:32.990 --> 11:34.260
Ah, I forgot to take it!

11:39.890 --> 11:40.860
I'll take it today for sure!

11:41.200 --> 11:42.060
Kato-san!

11:42.060 --> 11:42.460
Huh?

11:43.760 --> 11:45.270
These are the pictures I took from before.

11:45.700 --> 11:46.810
Uh, thanks...

11:52.240 --> 11:53.640
I missed my chance again...

11:54.980 --> 11:57.510
Strange... Why can't I get the timing right?

11:58.350 --> 12:00.350
Kato-san! Where are you going?

12:01.570 --> 12:02.220
The bathroom.

12:02.220 --> 12:03.650
Uh, sorry...

12:04.220 --> 12:05.150
Yet again...

12:08.820 --> 12:11.210
Nishitani is totally weird.

12:12.090 --> 12:13.790
He's completely obsessing over me.

12:14.560 --> 12:15.360
Kato-san!

12:19.230 --> 12:20.430
She's not here?

12:20.900 --> 12:21.340
Kato-san'?

12:23.170 --> 12:26.480
Damn, I didn't have any reason to hide...

12:30.710 --> 12:33.180
I didn't take Nishitani's heart at all...

12:33.910 --> 12:35.420
What the heck am I doing?

12:38.490 --> 12:43.180
Really? Thank you! That makes me ha-ppy!

12:47.260 --> 12:48.360
Sugar Sugar Rune!

12:49.360 --> 12:50.230
Vani Rune!

12:52.830 --> 12:53.330
Wand!

12:54.900 --> 12:57.020
Heart, heart, please come to me!

13:02.040 --> 13:02.740
Huh?

13:03.380 --> 13:03.880
See ya.

13:04.550 --> 13:05.480
Uh, sure.

13:07.210 --> 13:08.680
Ah, Chocolat-chan!

13:09.080 --> 13:12.650
Isn't that nice, Vanilla?
Another orange heart.

13:13.520 --> 13:15.520
I tried using Blanca's advice.

13:16.390 --> 13:20.850
You did? Duke, that little...
he's totally useless!

13:21.360 --> 13:22.160
I'll whup his butt!

13:25.400 --> 13:26.970
Is someone talking about me?

13:27.600 --> 13:29.910
It's tough being such a popular guy.

13:30.170 --> 13:32.610
You still haven't taken
Nishitani-kun's heart?

13:33.070 --> 13:35.480
Well... the timing's always
been off somehow.

13:35.940 --> 13:37.650
But... today I'm gonna take it!

13:37.650 --> 13:38.850
Put this to an end!

13:39.850 --> 13:40.850
Kato-san!

13:41.520 --> 13:43.420
Alright, this time for sure...

13:43.420 --> 13:44.920
Chocolat-chan, you can do it!

13:45.550 --> 13:46.490
Come! Come over here!

13:47.760 --> 13:48.390
What is it?

13:49.390 --> 13:51.160
I've got something to show you!

13:51.890 --> 13:53.190
This time you won't get away.

14:01.740 --> 14:04.270
Is that... ME?!

14:06.140 --> 14:08.180
I made it all by myself.

14:09.040 --> 14:10.410
Ah, it's that girl.

14:10.410 --> 14:10.980
It is!

14:11.550 --> 14:14.780
Even though Ice is a transfer student
too, it's only about Kato.

14:15.580 --> 14:17.650
Does Nishitani like Kato?

14:19.420 --> 14:20.520
Guess the secret's out!

14:21.690 --> 14:25.390
Even though he hasn't said a
single word about liking me,

14:25.390 --> 14:27.710
why did he make all this without telling me?

14:28.900 --> 14:30.830
Is this the power of human love?

14:36.870 --> 14:38.730
What do you think you're doing, Nishitani?!

14:39.170 --> 14:41.610
Just making a newspaper
about your own interests!

14:42.610 --> 14:46.710
You've always said that the newspaper
should be for everyone, chief.

14:46.710 --> 14:48.950
Isn't this just a newspaper for yourself?

14:50.050 --> 14:53.750
Even Akira's special alien feature
would have been better than this.

14:53.750 --> 14:57.530
Yeah, and the ghost of the north stairway
would have definitely been better.

14:57.930 --> 14:59.860
Chief, you're way too weak with girls.

15:00.620 --> 15:02.660
S-Stop being so selfish!

15:02.660 --> 15:04.500
YOU'RE the one being selfish!

15:04.500 --> 15:07.270
Yeah, making this stupid
paper up all by yourself!

15:07.800 --> 15:09.840
We're also quitting the newspaper club.

15:11.140 --> 15:12.070
Got a problem with that?

15:12.770 --> 15:14.310
Nishitani's too selfish.

15:14.310 --> 15:15.240
Let's get out of here.

15:20.640 --> 15:22.150
What? Dammit.

15:24.490 --> 15:24.890
Huh?

15:26.350 --> 15:28.740
He broke off his friendship with Akira,

15:28.740 --> 15:32.060
and suffered all those
complaints from his friends...

15:33.030 --> 15:33.590
Nishitani's...

15:34.460 --> 15:36.230
Nishitani's really a...

15:38.130 --> 15:39.230
You idiot!

15:40.970 --> 15:41.870
Why?!

15:42.640 --> 15:46.070
Why did you fight with your friends
just for a newspaper about me?!

15:48.110 --> 15:50.810
"Why?" you ask... I don't know either.

15:51.910 --> 15:54.280
I just felt like it was
something I had to do.

15:55.580 --> 15:59.390
Even I... Even I don't understand it at all!

16:02.220 --> 16:03.220
It was the first time...

16:03.890 --> 16:06.430
...for me to get that enthusiastic about
something I wanted to do.

16:07.630 --> 16:10.880
In the newspaper club I was always the peacemaker,

16:10.880 --> 16:13.400
always doing what
other people wanted to do.

16:21.880 --> 16:23.310
The heart's turned pink!

16:25.180 --> 16:29.720
Nishitani, I'll be taking that
crystal of your feelings!

16:31.920 --> 16:33.090
Hey, look over here.

16:34.020 --> 16:34.600
Sure.

16:39.930 --> 16:40.960
Agrandissment!

16:42.460 --> 16:43.830
Sugar Sugar Rune!

16:43.830 --> 16:44.600
Choco Rune!

16:59.810 --> 17:00.250
Wand!

17:09.420 --> 17:09.960
Alright!

17:11.890 --> 17:15.200
Your heart... Pick up!

18:02.510 --> 18:05.510
Huh? What... was I doing?

18:10.220 --> 18:12.790
Now Nishitani won't have
feelings for me anymore.

18:14.720 --> 18:18.530
What's this? Shouldn't I be happy
about taking a heart?

18:18.530 --> 18:20.390
Why am I a little sad?

18:21.360 --> 18:25.530
But Nishitani, giving me this pretty
pink heart really helps me out.

18:26.600 --> 18:28.340
I'll help you make up with everyone!

18:30.640 --> 18:31.940
Sugar Sugar Rune!

18:31.940 --> 18:32.870
Choco Rune!

18:33.970 --> 18:35.660
Ghost! I summon you!

18:47.090 --> 18:47.690
That's...

18:58.670 --> 19:00.330
The ghost of the north stairway!

19:12.510 --> 19:13.680
It's really a ghost!

19:14.380 --> 19:15.880
But... during the day?

19:17.720 --> 19:18.750
Gotta get a picture!

19:24.360 --> 19:25.190
It disappeared.

19:29.460 --> 19:31.270
Wow! I took it!

19:31.730 --> 19:33.470
The ghost of the north stairway!

19:33.900 --> 19:35.470
Wow! This is incredible!

19:35.940 --> 19:36.970
I took its picture!

19:38.570 --> 19:40.540
Do your best to make up with your friends.

19:41.180 --> 19:43.040
Chocolat-chan, I saw the newspaper.

19:43.040 --> 19:44.780
You got a special feature, that's amazing!

19:45.310 --> 19:46.750
Vanilla, look, look!

19:47.280 --> 19:48.980
Ah! A pink heart!

19:49.350 --> 19:51.490
You did it! That's my Chocolat-chan!

19:52.320 --> 19:54.000
Hmph. Cocky little...

19:55.420 --> 19:58.490
And you see, I did some
magic for Nishitani...

19:59.060 --> 20:02.220
This is incredible!
The ghost is actually real!

20:02.630 --> 20:06.520
This'll be Moegi Newspaper's gripping,
great, super, extra-large scoop!

20:06.930 --> 20:09.100
Wow, you're so kind, Chocolat-chan!

20:11.970 --> 20:14.440
Chocolat, you really are
an idiot, aren't you?

20:14.880 --> 20:15.510
What?!

20:16.140 --> 20:16.710
Why?

20:17.380 --> 20:20.150
It's too bad, but the things you can
summon at your magic level

20:20.150 --> 20:23.950
can't have their picture
taken by a human camera.

20:24.380 --> 20:28.560
Eh?! Then, does this mean Nishitani
can't make up with his friends?

20:29.820 --> 20:30.720
This is really amazing!

20:36.960 --> 20:38.230
It didn't show up....

20:44.540 --> 20:48.740
Oh yeah... everyone quit.

20:46.050 --> 20:52.060
Newspaper Club

20:49.780 --> 20:52.050
That's why I said it should
be an alien special!

20:53.550 --> 20:55.050
The ghost of the north stairway!

20:55.680 --> 20:58.070
No, it should be a special
Vanilla-chan issue!

20:58.250 --> 21:00.050
What? That's just...

21:00.820 --> 21:02.650
Everyone's just trying to do
what they want.

21:04.260 --> 21:09.060
Ah, Nishitani always mediated
and kept us organized.

21:09.060 --> 21:09.800
Yeah...

21:20.770 --> 21:23.210
You're late, dummy.

21:24.650 --> 21:27.880
Be quiet. You're not even
a member of the club.

21:28.850 --> 21:30.420
Why are you always here?

21:35.020 --> 21:41.020
Newspaper Club

21:37.790 --> 21:39.290
Hey, let's have an editing meeting..

21:39.290 --> 21:40.390
Sure, let's...

21:40.390 --> 21:41.900
So what would be good?

21:41.900 --> 21:42.560
An alien special!

21:50.370 --> 21:53.040
Strange... he made up with
his friends all by himself.

21:55.310 --> 22:00.250
I see. You can always go
back to your friends.

22:01.850 --> 22:05.450
Friendship doesn't disappear
like love, does it?

22:23.130 --> 22:29.440
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.570 --> 22:30.940
"Love"

22:31.880 --> 22:35.380
A magic spell.

22:37.520 --> 22:44.790
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.220 --> 22:54.300
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.970 --> 23:00.240
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.840 --> 23:03.910
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.210 --> 23:11.280
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.650 --> 23:16.090
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.090 --> 23:26.200
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.260 --> 23:35.110
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:45.900 --> 23:47.200
Love potions!

23:47.200 --> 23:49.100
Candy to make your voice pretty!

23:49.100 --> 23:50.100
Lover's mirrors!

23:50.100 --> 23:53.580
The Magical World Mail Order Catalogue has all kinds of cool items!

23:53.580 --> 23:55.210
What should I get?

23:55.610 --> 23:58.620
I should get something I could use for tomorrow's play!

23:58.620 --> 24:01.880
Our class is performing the greatest love tragedy!

24:01.880 --> 24:04.660
Eh?! I'm not the star?

24:04.660 --> 24:06.260
Why am I a watchman?

24:06.990 --> 24:08.790
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.790 --> 24:10.690
The magic lipstick hints of love...

24:11.180 --> 24:12.840
If you don't watch, I'll whup your butt!

24:12.840 --> 24:13.990
Thanks!
